            <ArticleTitle>Pregnancy in diabetic woman with coexisting hypothyroidism, coronary artery disease and with early onset nephrotic syndrome--a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>305-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a case of pregnancy in 28-years old nulliparous woman with an over 20-years long history of diabetes, hypothyroidism, diabetic nephropathy with nephrotic syndrome, retinopathy and coronary artery disease treated with PCA prior the pregnancy (class H diabetes, according to White classification).</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
